{"type":"message","id":"225d8b7b","parentId":"1053982c","timestamp":"2026-04-10T13:05:31.793Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] **Recommended questions**\nThat makes this more important, because reduced tolerance for even small physical activity can fit simple fatigue, but it can also point toward a cardiovascular, respiratory, metabolic, or blood-related contributor.\n\n**(3/5)** During or after those small activities, do you notice **shortness of breath, chest pressure/pain, fast or irregular heartbeat, dizziness/lightheadedness, or ankle/leg swelling**?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0b1f2e0e9b82f35e0169d8f59930cc8191a8704fa184df58fc\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":335,"output":94,"cacheRead":23552,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23981,"cost":{"input":0.0008375,"output":0.00141,"cacheRead":0.005888,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0081355}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775826326325}}
